    "Description": "### Summary\n\nA flaw in the SSH service allows an authenticated client to crash the server by sending a malformed protocol message while opening a channel.\n\n### Impact\n\nAny user able to authenticate over SSH can trigger an unhandled error condition that aborts the server process. This results in a denial of service affecting all connected users until the service is restarted. No confidentiality or integrity impact has been identified; the issue is limited to availability.",
